        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Hotel.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "I've arranged everything.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "Ah—what is she like? Is she beautiful?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "She possesses thirty-three marks of beauty.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "What, man—you've added one new mark!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "You'll know that mark when you see her in person.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "Ah!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "Though born a courtesan, she's just the sort of golden creeper you would describe, Paranthama!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "Garuda!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "The moment I saw her, an idea came to me!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u011",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d010",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "What?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d011",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "We could put her on the cover of the second edition of our book 'Vaazhu'!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u013",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s071-d012",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh, keep quiet, you businessman!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s071-u014",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 87,
            "printedPage": 79
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Paranthaman leaves for the courtesan's house.)",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
